        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n*** STUNNING 1 BEDROOM APARTMENT *** IMMACULATE CONDITION THROUGHOUT *** FULLY FURNISHED *** PRIME DUBLIN 8 LOCATION ***\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this exceptional one-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment to the rental market, ideally situated in the highly sought-after The Brazen, City Gate, Dublin 8.\nThis beautifully presented apartment is offered in immaculate condition throughout and boasts bright, stylish, and contemporary living accommodation. The property comprises an inviting entrance hallway, spacious open-plan living and dining area, fully fitted modern kitchen, generously proportioned double bedroom with ample storage, and a sleek main bathroom.\nThe apartment has been meticulously maintained and finished to a high standard, offering comfortable and modern living in one of Dublin 8's most convenient and vibrant locations.\nThe Brazen, City Gate is ideally positioned close to Dublin City Centre and is within easy reach of a wide range of cafés, restaurants, bars, shops, gyms, and other local amenities. The area benefits from excellent public transport links, with numerous bus routes and convenient access to the LUAS, while Dublin City Centre is just a short distance away.\nAdditional Features:\n<ul>\n <li>1 Bed / 1 Bath</li>\n <li>Fully furnished throughout</li>\n <li>Immaculate condition</li>\n <li>Bright and spacious living accommodation</li>\n <li>Modern fully fitted kitchen</li>\n <li>Generous double bedroom</li>\n <li>Ample storage</li>\n <li>Highly sought-after The Brazen, City Gate location</li>\n <li>Excellent transport links</li>\n <li>Convenient access to Dublin City Centre</li>\n <li>Close to a wide range of local amenities</li>\n</ul>\nAVAILABLE NOW\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND 